> On Monday morning a new classmate joined her class. Her name was Zhang Yue.
老师|lǎoshī 说|shuō ： “ 小文|Xiǎowén|Xiaowen,_short_for_Wang_Xiaowen|N ， 张月|Zhāng_Yuè 坐|zuò 在|zài 你|nǐ 旁边|pángbiān ， 好|hǎo 吗|ma ？ ”
> The teacher said, “Xiaowen, Zhang Yue will sit next to you, all right?”
小文|Xiǎowén 说|shuō ： “ 好|hǎo ！ ”
> “Yes!” said Xiaowen.

